{
  "summary": "Tenstorrent's Blackhole is a manycore of Tensix cores on a 2D network-on-chip. Each Tensix pairs five small RISC-V controllers with a matrix engine, a vector engine and 1.5 MB of private SRAM; there are no caches between cores. The p150 cards expose 120 Tensix cores, 32 GB of GDDR6, sixteen large RISC-V CPU cores and 800G Ethernet ports for direct card-to-card scale-out.",
